<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TanRick Services | Institutional Systems & Capital Allocation</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0d0e12;
            --card-bg: #13151a;
            --text-main: #f3f4f6;
            --text-muted: #9ca3af;
            --accent-cyan: #06b6d4;
            --border-color: #1f2937;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        header {
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.05em;
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .mission-panel {
            background-color: #171923;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-cyan);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        .mission-title {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .mission-text {
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .section-block {
            display: grid;
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .top-row {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }

        .bottom-row {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        }

        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .top-row, .bottom-row {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        .card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
        }

        .card:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .center-pillar {
            border: 1px solid #2e3b4e;
            background-color: #151821;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
        }

        .center-pillar:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .card-content h2 {
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .card-content p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background-color: transparent;
            color: var(--text-main);
            border: 1px solid var(--text-main);
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            border-radius: 4px;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--text-main);
            color: var(--bg-color);
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 4rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-top: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <!-- Header Block -->
    <header>
        <h1>TanRick Services</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Holding Infrastructure, Systems Architecture & Capital Allocation</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Mission Statement Block -->
    <div class="mission-panel">
        <div class="mission-title">Corporate Mission Statement</div>
        <div class="mission-text">To engineer absolute institutional clarity, structure multi-divisional corporate holding matrices, and optimize high-performance algorithmic frameworks across global borders.</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Top Row: Primary Trading & Analysis Nodes -->
    <div class="section-block top-row">
        <!-- Division 1: Technical Analysis Page Link -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h2>Trading Technical Analysis Services</h2>
                <p>Deploying proprietary systematic execution models, institutional order-flow analytics, and advanced volatility-space indicators engineered explicitly for high-velocity futures contract extraction.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="analysis/" class="btn">View Technical Specifications</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Division 2: Active Capital Allocation Page Link -->
        <div class="card center-pillar">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h2>Trading Services</h2>
                <p style="color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 500;">Managing over $150,000 in active allocated capital across institutional prop-firm frameworks, executing high-volume liquidity capturing strategies within daily macro volatility boxes.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="trading/" class="btn" style="border-color: var(--accent-cyan); color: var(--accent-cyan);">Review Allocation Portfolio</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Row: Supporting Operational Enterprise Nodes -->
    <div class="section-block bottom-row">
        <!-- Division 3: IT Consultancy Page Link -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h2>IT Consultancy Services</h2>
                <p>Designing high-availability enterprise infrastructure, bespoke database architectures, and secure, containerized software systems tailored for high-frequency environments.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="consultancy/" class="btn">Examine Enterprise Solutions</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Division 4: Property Page Link -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h2>Property Services</h2>
                <p>Structuring cross-border real estate acquisitions, strategic asset insulation frameworks, and high-yield physical portfolio optimization across international tax boundaries.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="property/" class="btn">Inspect Asset Portfolio</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Division 5: AI Training Page Link -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h2>AI Training Services</h2>
                <p>Optimizing deep neural network data scaling, advanced LLM behavioral tuning, prompt engineering architectures, and automated semantic workflow systems.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="aitraining/" class="btn">Review Training Frameworks</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Corporate Footer Node -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 TanRick Services. All rights reserved. Executive Command Node: ceo@tanrickservices.com</p>
    </footer>
</div>

</body>
</html>
